NTEED DELIVERY AND ACCEPTED FOR PURCHASE WILL BE PURCHASED ON THE THIRD BUSINESS DAY AFTER THE EXPIRATION TIME, BUT PAYMENT OF ACCRUED INTEREST ON SUCH NOTES WILL ONLY BE MADE TO, BUT NOT INCLUDING, THE SETTLEMENT DATE.'}